jobs.description:
- Venlo - 40 uur - € 15,68 per uur 
Are you someone who likes to roll up their sleeves, works accurately and enjoys a dynamic working environment? Then we are looking for you! As a Warehouse Employee, you will work in a modern distribution centre in Venlo, where you and your colleagues are responsible for processing and preparing orders for shipment across Europe and the Middle East. 
What do we offer? 
• A gross hourly wage of €15.68; 
• A full-time position of 40 hours per week; 
• A high chance of receiving a permanent contract; 
• Double pay on Sundays and public holidays; 
• Travel allowance of €0.21 per kilometre; 
• Flexible day shifts between 07:00 and 19:00; 
• 30% overtime allowance; 
• 200% pay on Sundays; 
• Paid training and plenty of opportunities for personal and professional development; 
• Working in a modern and sustainable distribution centre in Venlo; 
• An international and dynamic working environment; 
• Access to an exclusive Sample Sale featuring well-known fashion brands. 
What will you do? 
As a Warehouse Employee, you are an important part of the logistics process. 
Your responsibilities will include: - Picking and processing orders for customers across Europe and the Middle East; - Picking fashion items in the warehouse; - Moving and processing goods within the warehouse; - Checking orders and preparing them for shipment; - Identifying and reporting discrepancies and quality issues; - Working together with colleagues and supervisors to ensure orders are processed correctly and on time; - Keeping the workplace clean and safe; - Working according to applicable safety and quality regulations. 
What do you bring? - You are willing to work weekends; - You speak and understand English, as this is the main language spoken on the work floor; - You are motivated, reliable and hardworking; - You work accurately and have an eye for quality; - Experience in logistics is a plus, but motivation and a good work ethic are...

Vacaturebeschrijving
   Join a leading logistics organization with a modern fleet featuring top brands like Volvo and DAF. To support the expansion of our operations, we are looking for driven CE Truck Drivers to elevate our hooklift container transport. You will be on the road from Monday to Friday and enjoy your well-deserved rest over the weekend.  Functieomschrijving:
 What you will do as a CE Truck Driver- Transport hooklift containers throughout the Netherlands and occasionally Germany in a modern Volvo or DAF;
- Work on the road from Monday to Friday, sleeping in your own dedicated cab;
- Work 60 to 70 hours per week and enjoy 2 full weeks off every 8 weeks;
- Safely deliver and drop off containers at various client sites and locations;
- Accurately maintain journey logs and keep your truck in top condition.


  Functievereisten:
 What you bring as a CE Truck Driver- A valid CE driver's license, Code 95, and driver card;
- Willingness to spend nights in the cab from Monday to Friday;
- Own transportation to travel to the depot;
- A flexible mindset to work 60 to 70 hours per week;
- Good command of either the Dutch or English language.


  Arbeidsvoorwaarden:
 What you earn as a CE Truck Driver- Highly attractive gross monthly salary ranging from €5,108.55 to €5,965.00 per month.
- Unique work schedule with 2 mandatory weeks off every 8 weeks.
- International allowance and an average net allowance of €200 per week for travel and accommodation costs.
- Access to your own dedicated truck right after the onboarding period.
- Fully covered hotel accommodation during the onboarding period.
- Guaranteed weekends off, every single week.
- Drive modern, new equipment (DAF and Volvo) from a continuously renewed fleet.
- An international and accessible work environment where English-speaking drivers are warmly welcomed.

Ready to sink your teeth into the role of CE Truck Driver in the Amsterdam area? Apply now—it takes just 2 minutes! 
